ated 728 all-purpose yards as a senior. Luckie was rated a four-star recruit and committed to play college football at Georgia over offers from Alabama, Auburn, Florida State, LSU, Ole Miss, and Texas A&M."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Luckie joined the Georgia Bulldogs as an early enrollee in December 2022 and took part in the team's practices leading up to the 2022 Peach Bowl. He played in seven games as a true freshman and caught two passes for nine yards and one touchdown."}]}}